![](https://scontent-b-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/t1/1451480_10151751041782647_1115544237_n.jpg)

The brand new song of Brooklyn-based indie rockers The Library Is On Fire just leaked through Flowers In A Gun! “Labyrinths of February” is a standout track from The Library is On Fire’s new album “Halcyon & Surrounding Areas”, which will be released on April 15th. “Inspired by the loneliness of life in the city, the song conjures a poetic metaphor of the search for connection through the austere, relentless cold and snow of a winter in New York.” says frontman Steve Five.

[DOWNLOAD IT FOR FREE HERE!](http://snk.to/f-cdpl7y4s)

